                                                "sense_id": "6a2307a4-05f2-3ab2-afab-3031afd7474c",
                                                "text": "Like those many works before it, Saltburn plays with the idea that these enormous bastions of privilege and power are unique breeding grounds for strangeness – and, crucially, magnets for it too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
